## Design contract (headscale-management)

This is an **infrastructure control plane** admin UI (tenants, workers, gateways).

### Visual system
- Read **`DESIGN.md`** at project root for colors, typography, components, spacing.
- Style: Supabase-inspired — dark dashboard, emerald accent (`#3ecf8e`), data-dense tables.

### UX workflow
- For UI/UX tasks, follow **ui-ux-pro-max** skill (`.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md`).
- Run design-system search when starting a new page:
  `python3 .cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py "<page purpose>" --design-system -p "Headscale Management"`

### Hierarchy
1. `design-system/headscale-management/pages/<page>.md` (if exists)
2. `DESIGN.md`
3. `design-system/headscale-management/MASTER.md`

### Defaults
- Dark mode default
- Icons: Lucide or Heroicons SVG — no emoji icons
- `cursor-pointer` on clickable elements; visible focus states
- Responsive: 375 / 768 / 1024 / 1440 px
